{# The tool's trail, shared by its screens: Accueil › Nuage de mots, then the cloud's own name on
   the screens that are about one cloud.

   Since 2026-11-12 a cloud belongs to a class or to none (design/validated/word-cloud-public.md), and
   the list is no longer reached through a class: the class is one of its filters, so the « Nuage
   de mots » segment leads back to the list filtered on the cloud's class when it has one. Built here
   once and extended with |merge by the callers, every segment a real <a href>. #}
{% set listParams = cloud is defined and cloud is not null and cloud.program ? {class: cloud.program.id} : {} %}
{% set segments = [
    {label: 'wordCloudNavLabel'|trans, url: path('app_word_clouds', listParams)},
] %}
{% if cloud is defined and cloud is not null and cloud.id %}
    {% set segments = segments|merge([{label: cloud.name, url: path('app_word_cloud_pilot', {cloudId: cloud.id})}]) %}
{% elseif newLabel is defined %}
    {% set segments = segments|merge([{label: newLabel, url: app.request.requestUri}]) %}
{% endif %}
{{ component('Cm:Breadcrumb', {segments: segments}) }}
